# Kept out of Cursor's context and indexing.
#
# docs/ holds the source PDFs and the .docx design guideline — roughly 500 KB of
# binary that indexes badly and is already distilled into context/. An agent
# that retrieves a PDF fragment gets worse information than one that reads
# context/30-design-system.md, and it spends far more of the window doing it.
# The documents remain authoritative for a human; they are not agent context.
docs/

node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
package-lock.json

# Deliberately non-conformant by design. Indexing it teaches the wrong patterns.
tools/__fixtures__/
